WEBVTT

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.750
My name is Shinka Nibutani.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.380
I am a Year Two student
at Icho Private High School.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.300
I'm a little bit of a klutz,
and can be stubborn...

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.000
...but everyone says I'm very dependable.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.040
Okay, time to go.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:25.930
Oh, Nibu. Morning!

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:26.640
Morning.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.500
Morning.
Morning.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.100
Morning, everyone.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.710
What? We had math homework?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.860
Haven't you done it either, Becky?
I was counting on you.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.440
Fukachi? Becky?
Would you like to see my notes?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.180
Are you sure?

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.140
MATH
Shinka Nibutani

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:41.140
Here.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:42.950
Thanks, Nibu!

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.160
I have no boyfriend. It's so lonely.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.560
No straight-out copying, okay?

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.910
But to be honest, I'm not all that
interested in romance right now.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.730
Yeah, I know.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.270
Aren't these answers above
your grade, Fukachi?

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:51.400
After all, I have a grand dream.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.400
What do you mean by that?

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:54.290
Yes, my grand dream.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.660
A dream I want to become reality
during my time in high school.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:05.960
STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION,
PRESIDENT OF STUDENT COUNCIL,
VICE-PRESIDENT, TREASURER, SECRETARY

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:58.910
I'll tell you what it is.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.040
Working for the student council work
is very rewarding.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.970
You devote yourself for benefit of
everyone in the school.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.080
Would anyone like to be a candidate?

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:09.710
PRESIDENT OF THE STUDENT COUNCIL

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:09.710
You can do it, Shinka!

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.730
Dreams can come true!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:46.390
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.220
I was going to stop there on the way home.
What do you say?

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.390
Shinka Nibutani

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.390
Backers?

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.900
That's right.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.190
Would you write your name on this register?

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.490
I guess I could do that.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.260
The Election For President Of The
Student Council (Queen Maker)... Of Purity

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.530
Okay, thanks.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.780
School: Wicked Lord Shingan, S Class
Name: Rikka Takanashi

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.780
What is that girl writing?

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.210
Also, now that I'm a candidate...

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:04.120
...I won't be making any appearances
at Club Whatchamacallit.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.800
You could at least remember the name
of the club you belong to.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.180
Image is important in an election.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:14.720
If people knew I belonged to that club,
it would harm my reputation.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:17.090
Why the student council of all things?

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.650
Weren't you working hard in the theatre club?

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.180
That place is lacking somehow.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.050
Not again.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.070
I don't know what it is. The magnetic field?

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:31.520
The spiritual wavelength?
It just doesn't feel right.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.020
Maybe the guardian spirits are
taking a different position on it.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.020
Can you hear yourself?

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:41.040
Naturally, that has nothing
to do with chunibyo!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.000
I was only speaking in general, that's all!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.910
Well, I won't try to stop you.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.340
But you keep going on about your reputation.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.290
People are already talking about you.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.920
Like how you chased after a freshman,
dressed as a witch.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.290
And how you threatened a freshman with
physical harm, dressed as a martian...

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.300
...and how you were trampled by a freshman,
dressed as a bug.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.650
They could think you're a complete weirdo.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.440
Those freshmen are all the one and the same!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.890
In other words, she is my only problem.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.350
Sanae Dekomori, servant to
Wicked Lord Shingan, is here!

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.560
I will defeat you today, once and for all!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.120
Ow. Speak of the devil.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.420
What were you secretly discussing?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.670
I can only assume that you were
plotting petty wickedness!

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.910
Why would I do that?!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:29.200
On this day, my attack power is doubled!
Prepare yourself!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.790
Take this! The Mjolnir Megaton Hammer!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.540
I already calculated your range.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.330
Nice try!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.420
What?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.000
Did you see that? Now you are mine!

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.510
What're you doing?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.510
NURSE'S
OFFICE

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.720
Do something!

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.020
Who, me?

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:48.190
I'll be going from class to class...

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.720
...to introduce myself as candidate
to the freshmen after school.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:54.030
She'll be sure to interfere if she's around.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.480
So you say.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.910
You can do this.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.860
Just get Takanashi to tell
that idiot to knock it off.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.420
So you're telling me to ask Rikka?

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.820
You're her boyfriend, right?
You're going out, right?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.040
"Rikka, if you love me..."

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.620
"...you'll do this for me."

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.590
One little whisper, and she'll do it.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.050
I can't say that! And why the heck
do I have to do that for you?!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.210
Help me!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.940
I helped you lots when you
told her how you felt about her.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.770
Sure, but nobody asked you to.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:24.230
I went all the way to Rikka's parent's
house to help you, didn't I?

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.110
Sure, but nobody asked you to.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:27.400
And what about that last date?

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.800
Nobody ever asked you to!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:31.720
"Ghelzonianses."

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.940
Where did you hear that?

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:41.270
Takanashi said she found it among
your notes the other day.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.990
It's the Dark Flame Master's
secondary form, right? Ghelzon...

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.860
Stop it! In all of my dark history,
that is uniquely embarrassing!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.120
Is it? Okay then...

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.240
Far-East Magical Napping Society -
Summer Thereof

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.640
Why am I doing this?

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.920
Ooh, the Dark Flame Master has descended.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.730
It would appear, that due to the urging
of the Wicked Lord Shingan...

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.670
...the Dark Flame Dragon that
resides within me has become active.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.680
Ooh! Is this an omen of your
transformation into Ghelzonianses?

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.830
Uh, no, I...

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.100
...no, it'll keep.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.530
Especially this evening.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:18.690
At twilight, my heart will
pound like a hammer...

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.910
...and my entire body will heat up
like a raging fire!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.860
Be still, my arm!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.720
Understood. Leave it to me.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.990
Not yet! It's too soon!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.960
Dekomori will join you in battle!

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.110
Be destroyed, real.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.490
Blow up, synapses.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:33.240
Banishment, This World!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.290
You came, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:47.050
Forgive me. I cannot seem to control myself.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.540
Is the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.430
...attempting to absorb you,
Dark Flame Master? If so...

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.260
Avalon Smasher!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.100
Wait!

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.310
Where is Dekomori?

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:01.720
She vanished!

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.990
Did she fall through
the loophole of the parallel world?

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.940
She just kind of ran from the room...

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:09.880
...when I mentioned that Mori Summer
was visiting the freshmen's classrooms.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:10.950
This is bad!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.210
Don't!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:15.160
We must do something before the
Dark Flame Dragon overtakes you!

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.620
Avalon Smasher!

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:17.970
Wait! Wait!

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.790
Yuta, hold still. This
will require careful aim.

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.560
I'll be going now.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.760
Her classroom is next.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:31.430
I hope that Togashi is keeping her
in check like I asked.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.850
Yes! She isn't here! Thank you, Togashi!

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:36.990
2-4 Shinka Nibutani

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:41.000
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.890
My name is
Shinka Nibutani from Year Two...

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.860
...and I am here as candidate
for president of the student council.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.820
I am here today to present my candidacy.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.420
This really takes me back.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.000
This was my classroom last year.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:55.240
On the day of the entrance ceremony

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.160
I actually came to this classroom by mistake.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.220
Okay, the connection is made.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.470
Now all I have to do is impress them
with my dependability.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.930
Anyway, I can be a bit of a scatterbrain...

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.210
...but I love my school more than any...

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.260
U-um, well...

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:18.240
Well, I love my school more than...

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.060
...anyone!

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.530
I hope for your honest vote...

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:25.060
Ow!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:29.620
Your honest vote for Shinka Nibutani.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:30.900
Thank you for...

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.120
...for your time!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:46.680
Togashi!

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:47.970
You're blaming me?!

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.780
Of course I am!

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.900
To add insult to injury...

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.730
...you were being mushy with Togashi
in the club room!

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.510
Watch what you say!

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.220
Kumin-senpai, I wish you wouldn't
leak incorrect information.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.990
But you were trying to summon
the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:06.060
Going "Ooh! Aah!" the whole time.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.500
Enough of the impersonations.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:12.860
I will not allow an imposter
to rule the campus!

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.900
You guys are disturbing the other patrons.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.070
Rikka, make Dekomori stop.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:20.890
That was close.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.700
Order yours without in the first place!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.670
Hero?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.420
Shichimiya!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:29.060
Stop that!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.380
Sorry, I couldn't help it.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:31.630
Shichimiya?

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:35.630
Sophia!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.310
Mori Summer! Long time no see!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.670
You go to the same school as Hero.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.400
Are you 1,216 years old now?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.350
Are you the Devil?!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.120
W-w-who might you be?

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.370
My name is Catherine Suzuki.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.600
You chose to be a half?!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.980
So you transferred to the middle school
Nibutani was attending?

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:58.330
Yeah. As a magician
who has lived for 1,200 years,

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:02.620
Mori Summer fought in this world
alongside the magical devil girl.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:04.400
Don't worry.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.600
As long as you abide by the teachings
in the Mabinogion...

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.000
...you can save everyone in the world.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:11.190
Really?!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.750
Yes, so you must pray.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.760
I made this crystal potion for you.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.830
Wow, thank you!

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:21.230
Sophia, I am sure the angel is nearby.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:21.680
Yes!

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:25.710
Stop!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.660
Stop it, Nibutani! The wall is innocent.

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:31.770
I guess that means that you're really
Mori Summer, Mori Summer.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.690
Be wary, Kumin.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.940
The magical devil girl
has been known to use illusion.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.450
Exactly! She couldn't
possibly be the true one.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:44.300
What? But Mori Summer is 100% Mori Summer.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.040
I declare it to be so on Satan's name. Look!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.790
Would you look at that!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.750
Stop it!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:54.940
Are you really still doing
that stuff at your age?

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.960
Grow out of it already.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.480
The magical devil girl is eternal!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.260
The words "Grow out of it"
are not in my dictionary!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.400
It's really her?

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:06.440
No, this isn't enough to
determine her legitimacy.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.730
Mori Summer is far more noble...

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.440
Th-this hand accessory.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.160
It's the same!

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:16.690
The multicolored gemstones are unmistakable.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:19.530
Which means...

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:21.680
Huh?

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:34.600
My name is Sanae Dekomori.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:37.130
I am a Year One student at
Icho Private High School.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:42.380
In this world, I am 15
years and 8 months old.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.320
Morning, Deko!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:40.770
Oh, good morning!

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.380
We start out with Phys Ed.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:46.420
Yes. Mornings are difficult
due to lowered magical power.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.260
I have been proactive in the battle

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.130
in the parallel world as
my master's servant...

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.040
Magic?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.480
Oh, come on.

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:52.160
...until I had a shocking encounter!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.090
I'm sorry, I must go ahead.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.100
Um, sure.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.610
Yes, until my chance encounter...

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.360
...with the mentor of my soul, my other master,
Mistress Mori Summer!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.920
Mistress Mori Summer!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.200
Good morning!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.970
Morning.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:08.300
Mistress Mori Summer?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:12.850
Dekomori respects Mori Summer
only second to myself.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.680
Naturally, she calls her Mistress.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.250
I told you, Deko.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.460
I can't tell people who I really am...

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.460
...so you can't call me Mori Summer.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.970
You're right. Very well, Nibutani-senpai.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.180
Yes, well done.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.320
Now I, Dekomori, must head to class.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:33.490
I will come to see you on my breaks, Moris...

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.810
I mean, Nibutani-senpai!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.670
I'm amazed!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.860
I guess, but it's exhausting.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:50.870
She keeps coming to see me
on every single break.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.080
Wouldn't she obey you if you told her
to keep her distance?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:57.170
I tried already. This is what happened.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.380
Mistress Mori Summer...
Mistress Mori Summer, do you...

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.630
Do you not like me anymore?

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.690
Um, no, it's not that.

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:10.910
Why does she have to cry?
That girl is way too edgy.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:14.410
I just knew it, Mori Summer.
You do like Dekomori.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:15.910
What makes you say that?

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.770
But won't this make the student
council election easier to do?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.110
Well, sure, she'll probably listen
to me if I ask her not to interfere.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:27.990
Student Council Election
Special Edition

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.180
Not that. Ask her to help you...

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.990
...and I'll bet she'll be really helpful.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.550
Remember how she said she was
popular with the freshmen?

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.740
Dekomori is an excellent servant.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.520
As her master, I would be willing...

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.260
...to temporarily put her at your disposal.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.980
But if you did that...

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:46.260
...she might just stay on as
Mori Summer's servant for good.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:50.440
I see. This is my chance
to ask her to assist me.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:51.470
What?

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:55.480
Of course! Please allow me to assist you!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.580
Really?

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:00.120
Yes! For I know.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:02.940
Mistress Mo... I mean, Nibutani-senpai.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.540
Once you are president,

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.250
you will convert this
school to Shangri-La protected by the spirits

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:09.220
as it is recorded in the Mabinogion.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:13.530
Keep that secret!
Everyone will find out who I really am.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:15.130
Yes, you're right.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.920
So can I count on your help then?

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:22.890
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:26.050
I am Shinka Nibutani, and I am a candidate
for president of the student council.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.550
Thank you for your support!
I will make three promises to you,

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.530
to make your student life even better.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:33.980
I am Makoto Isshiki, and I am a candidate
for president of the student council.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.310
Vote for Makoto Isshiki!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:38.990
Now, it is done.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:41.400
Wow, you're good at artwork too.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:45.860
I Am Serious About Your Future -
SHINKA NIBUTANI

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.860
Nibutani-senpai's poster is kind of sublime.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.790
You can tell how much Deko
respects her by looking at it.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:51.470
Yeah, for sure.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.910
Yay!

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.740
Thank you. I owe it all to you, Deko.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:58.000
I never dreamed I would get
so much freshman support.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.870
Yes, ma'am! You have a 70% approval rating!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.770
When did you guys become such good friends?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.480
I-I didn't do anything.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.690
What are you saying?
I, Dekomori and Mistress Mori Summer...

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:13.260
...have been bound together by
the holy ribbon for over 300 years!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.390
Isn't that right, Mistress Mori Summer?

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.850
What? Uh, yes. That's right.

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:20.810
Dekomori, the moon looks blue tonight.

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.830
We will summon the demon beast
and go hunting together.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.530
Really?

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.090
But...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.420
I am terribly sorry!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:34.780
Today, I have an important meeting to attend
with Mistress Mori Summer.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:37.540
I will accompany you on the
very next opportunity, I swear!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.930
Sorry about that. Well, let's get going.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.530
Yes, ma'am. Goodbye.

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.320
Togashi?

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.240
Oh, brother.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.130
Rikka?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:59.450
All right. I'll look at it with you.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:00.140
Really?

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.610
But only after you've done your homework.

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:07.900
For some reason, you say
the same things as the Priestess.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.460
Are you in collusion?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.030
No!

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.700
So, this is your room, Mistress Mori Summer?

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.130
It looks very common.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.890
Mistress Mori Summer, do you keep your

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.890
true identity secret from your family?

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:24.950
Y-yes.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:28.350
And you can bear the loneliness?
I am impressed.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:29.830
Th-thanks.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:33.090
Now, about my campaign speech
for the all-candidates' debate...

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.470
Yes, I am halfway through writing it.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.600
Yes, this should work.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.810
Thank you so much!

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.240
Also, um...

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:49.570
I made cookies.

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:57.050
Hey, is this me?

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.370
Yes.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.870
D-do you like them?

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:05.870
These are good.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:07.860
Really?!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.250
What a relief.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:15.130
I didn't notice it through all of her
spiteful comments...

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:19.390
...but she's surprisingly
genuine and thoughtful.

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:23.260
She might actually be really nice.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.870
LOCKED
AWAY

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:45.720
My name is Mori Summer.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.940
I am a magician who has lived for 400 years.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.930
I have heard the whisperings of the spirits,

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:52.980
and have come to grant you my council.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.190
Mistress Mori Summer...

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:06.600
I finally met you.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.580
What is it that troubles you?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.580
Please confide in me.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.110
Deko, no cell pics.

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.170
Just one photo.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:18.740
Please allow me this one photo
of your glorious presence.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:19.660
Deko.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:23.340
I beg you! Just this one photo!

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.120
Just this one!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.380
Oh, all right.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:32.680
Mistress Mori Summer!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.420
Master!

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:39.860
Master... Master...

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:44.310
I'm sorry about everything till now.
C'mon, stop crying.

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.190
Appear to me, Demon Beast!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:52.940
Reveal to me the resting place that I seek!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:57.280
At this rate, Nibutani really is
gonna win the election.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.700
President of the student council.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.120
President of the student council?

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:02.960
Shichimiya?

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:05.430
Are you the Demon Beast? Yuta, stand back!

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.680
Hey, no pulling!

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.500
Yuta, the bath is ready.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:16.710
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION
ALL-CANDIDATES DEBATE

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:13.940
A man always strives to reach the top!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:16.710
A man always has ambition!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:21.230
I, Makoto Isshiki, will go to the top
to be your dictator!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.730
Thank you!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.100
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION
ALL-CANDIDATES DEBATE

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.100
Isshiki, where are you going with that?

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.660
We're next. Are you nervous?

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.120
Did you remember to bring the draft?

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.170
I'm fine! I have the draft right here.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.530
Yesterday, I revised the previous version
of the speech

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.490
to convey your information to the masses
with more accuracy...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:44.240
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION
SHINKA NIBUTANI SUPPORT SPEECH
Sanae Dekomori

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.680
...and to change public perception.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.240
Now the draft carries
a much more powerful message.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.450
What? Oh.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:51.010
Next up is Miss Sanae Dekomori, who is
Shinka Nibutani's campaign speech manager.

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:55.420
Here! I'm going in.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:20:03.470
Candidate for President of the Student Council,
Year Two, Shinka Nibutani

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.520
Good afternoon.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.710
I am Sanae Dekomori, and I am
Shinka Nibutani's campaign speech manager.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.660
I will now convey the words spoken by
Mistress Mori Summer...

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:13.690
...warm and beneficial words,
to you, comrades all.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.530
Chapter one, paragraph three.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:24.530
The world is composed of love's
divine providence.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.380
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION
ALL-CANDIDATES DEBATE

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.200
I have spent the last 400 years

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.040
observing the internal workings
of the hearts of mankind.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:33.540
War. Hate. Strife.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.290
I can't help but wonder why mankind
continues these actions?

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.000
Join me, everyone.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:43.310
The spirits are always nearby
delivering their love!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:49.280
Stop it!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.370
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.520
Senpai?
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.730
Nibutani...

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.590
The critical hit?

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.150
85TH ANNUAL STUDENT COUNCIL ELECTION
RESULTS: PRESIDENT: Hitomi Ubushiro

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:04.780
DROPOUT: Shinka Nibutani,
Makoto Isshiki, Kenta Tanaka

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.420
Nibu didn't come today?

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.380
I think she stayed home.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.410
Far-East Magical Napping Society -
Summer Thereof

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.410
I nearly fell for her deception!

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:08.590
Just like that?!

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:09.790
Of course!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.140
The Mabinogion is gospel!

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.280
The words of this book caused her to suffer!

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:17.000
Proof that she is an imposter!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.560
Exactly.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:22.720
You are the only master for me, Master.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.570
My master!

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:27.930
My servant!

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.370
Good for them.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.480
This is good?

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.660
Nibutani?

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.440
She's gloomy.

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:36.270
Give that back.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.620
You showed yourself, imposter!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.360
Shut up! That Mabinogion is to
blame for everything!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.700
Hand it over!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.970
Do not talk righteously to me, imposter!

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.140
Just hand it over!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.990
I will never give it to an imposter!

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:53.330
Milk - Full Of Calcium

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:53.330
Just give it up already! Got it?!

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.540
Stop! Stop it!

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.140
It's much more relaxing this way.

00:21:58.140 --> 00:21:59.170
You find this relaxing?

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:03.910
Now hand it over!

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:05.970
To Be Continued
